# Data provider

Controls whether the app reads data from the bundled sample fixtures (`mock`) or
from the in-app API route handlers (`api`). Right now `api` still serves the
sample fixtures — swap the route handlers for real database queries later.

- `mock` (default) — components import sample data through the data-client.
- `api` — components fetch from `/api/*` route handlers.

```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_DATA_PROVIDER=mock
```

Set it before `next build`/`next dev`. Values prefixed with `NEXT_PUBLIC_` are
inlined into the client bundle at build time.